  "final_answer": "I found all the information needed. Here is the complete answer:\n\n## ✅ Recipe Found: French Ratatouille on Allrecipes\n\n### Recipe Details\n- **Title:** Ratatouille\n- **Source:** Allrecipes\n- **Submitted by:** lynette\n- **Updated:** January 20, 2026\n- **Rating:**  **4.6 stars** (✓ meets 4-star requirement)\n- **Reviews:** **798 Reviews** (✓ far exceeds the 15-review requirement)\n\n### Cooking Times\n- **Prep Time:** 15 minutes\n- **Cook Time:** 45 minutes\n- **Total Time:** **1 hour**\n- **Servings:** 4\n\n### Variety of Vegetables Included\nThe recipe features a colorful mix of **6 vegetables**:\n1. **Eggplant** (1)\n2. **Zucchini** (2)\n3. **Tomatoes** (2)\n4. **Fresh mushrooms**\n5. **Onion** (1)\n6. **Red or green bell pepper** (1)\n7. **Garlic** (for the flavor base)\n\nPlus seasonings: olive oil, dried parsley, salt, and grated Parmesan cheese.\n\n### Recipe Description\n> *\"This ratatouille recipe is my version of the terrific French vegetable stew made with fresh tomatoes and lots of summer vegetables. It's very versatile side dish and makes a delicious vegetarian main dish, too.\"*\n\nThe article also notes that ratatouille is a French Provençal dish consisting of stewed vegetables, with eggplant, tomatoes, zucchini, onions, and bell peppers being the classic staples — all of which are included in this recipe.",
